# The only environment variable this app has.
#
# Where the game server lives. Leave it UNSET unless the client is hosted on a different
# domain than the server:
#
#   - dev (two terminals)      unset. vite.config.ts proxies /socket.io and /img to :3001.
#   - one process in prod      unset. The server serves this build, so it's the same origin.
#   - Vercel + Render          SET IT. The client is on vercel.app, the server on onrender.com.
#
# Must be https:// (a Vercel page cannot talk to a plain-http server) and must be a bare
# origin with no path. Vite inlines this at BUILD time, so changing it needs a redeploy.
#
# VITE_SERVER_URL=https://blober-meme.onrender.com

# To try it locally, copy this file to .env.local (gitignored) and uncomment a line like:
# VITE_SERVER_URL=http://localhost:3001
